WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.127
What counts as a forest in India?

2
00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:04.586
In 2023, Parliament wrote

3
00:00:04.586 --> 00:00:06.033
a narrower answer.

4
00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:08.633
In 1996, in Godavarman, the

5
00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:10.577
Supreme Court read forest

6
00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.443
in its dictionary sense,

7
00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:13.928
whatever the ownership.

8
00:00:14.378 --> 00:00:16.450
The 2023 law covers land

9
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.090
notified as forest,

10
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.923
or recorded as forest since

11
00:00:20.923 --> 00:00:22.542
25 October 1980.

12
00:00:22.992 --> 00:00:24.618
Unrecorded land that looks

13
00:00:24.618 --> 00:00:26.619
like forest may fall outside it.

14
00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.923
But in February 2024, the

15
00:00:28.923 --> 00:00:31.075
Court ordered that Godavarman

16
00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:32.039
still applies

17
00:00:32.139 --> 00:00:34.315
while states record forest-like land.

18
00:00:34.765 --> 00:00:36.791
In September 2026, it agreed

19
00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:38.673
to examine whether the new

20
00:00:38.673 --> 00:00:40.120
definition is valid.

21
00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:41.893
Narrower in the Act.

22
00:00:42.193 --> 00:00:44.006
Wider, for now, in court.

23
00:00:44.556 --> 00:00:45.473
Your turn.

24
00:00:45.773 --> 00:00:47.748
Under Godavarman, what meaning

25
00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:48.867
does forest take?
